{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_75_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_75","textTraditional":"一、十有二年，春，王正月，庚午，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_75_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_75","textTraditional":"二、夏，楚人滅黃。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_75_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_75","textTraditional":"貫之盟，管仲曰：「江、黃遠齊而近楚。楚，為利之國也。若伐而不能救，則無以宗諸侯矣。」桓公不聽，遂與之盟。管仲死，楚伐江滅黃，桓公不能救，故君子閔之也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_75_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_75","textTraditional":"三、秋，七月。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_75_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_75","textTraditional":"四、冬，十有二月，丁丑，陳侯杵臼卒。","sentenceOrder":5}],"overrides":{}}